        'MCP server AI agents connect to for investigating OpenTelemetry telemetry. Use when an agent needs to query traces, metrics, or logs from Jaeger, Tempo, Prometheus, Loki, or a built-in OTLP collector — including LLM-specific analytics (USD cost, token usage, per-model stats).\n',
