      description:
        "Troubleshoot when expected OpenTelemetry spans don't reach the backend. Walks the chain top-to-bottom — code → SDK init → sampler → processor → exporter → network → backend ingest — with concrete tests at each step. Covers a missing endpoint, sampling drops, ctx.waitUntil drops on Cloudflare, init-order races, propagation breaks, exporter auth errors, and silent ratelimits.\n",
